    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηχ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sound forth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Jl.</u>
				3(4).14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nech.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Vett.Val.
				241.17
			</span></i>: c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κύκνειον
				ἐξηχεῖν</span>
