				Id.
				2.107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>1 Ep.Thess.</u>
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>utter senseless sounds,</i> of idiots, <i><span class="en">
				Polem.Phgn.
